#about-over-overleaf-modal.modal.fade(
	tabindex='-1'
	aria-labelledby='about-over-overleaf-title'
	aria-hidden='true'
)
	.modal-dialog.modal-lg.modal-dialog-centered
		.modal-content
			.modal-header
				h2#about-over-overleaf-title.modal-title About Over-Overleaf
				button.btn-close(
					type='button'
					data-bs-dismiss='modal'
					aria-label=translate('close')
				)
			.modal-body
				img.d-block.mx-auto.mb-4(
					src=buildImgPath('over-overleaf-logo.png')
					alt='Over-Overleaf'
					width='112'
					height='112'
				)
				p
					| Overleaf Community Edition is an open-source collaborative LaTeX platform, developed in the official 
					a(
						href='https://github.com/overleaf/overleaf'
						target='_blank'
						rel='noopener noreferrer'
					) overleaf/overleaf
					|  monorepo.
				p
					| Over-Overleaf is an extension of that monorepo. It adds multi-user administration, track changes, Git and GitLab connectors, and a configurable AI assistant.
				p.mb-0
					| The source code and the history of the adaptations are available in the 
					a(
						href='https://github.com/amontarn/over-overleaf'
						target='_blank'
						rel='noopener noreferrer'
					) amontarn/over-overleaf
					|  repository.
			.modal-footer
				button.btn.btn-secondary(type='button' data-bs-dismiss='modal') Close
